  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong>Welcome to FUNISM! We are a leading brand dedicated to the designer toy and collectible community. We specialize in officially licensed anime and pop-culture collectibles, featuring world-renowned IPs like Naruto, Evangelion (EVA), and Pokémon. Our highly detailed, magnetic, and interactive blind boxes are currently going viral among anime fans and desk-setup enthusiasts.</p><p><strong>• What makes us different:</strong>Unlike generic toys, our products are 100% officially licensed, meaning zero copyright risks and extremely high trust among the fandom. Our unique features (like detachable DIY parts and magnetic functions for PC cases) naturally drive impulse purchases. Combined with the thrill of rare \"secret\" figures, we see incredible community engagement and repeat purchase rates.</p><p><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong>Whether you are a content creator, a private community admin, or a deal/coupon platform, we offer highly competitive commissions of <strong>up to 15%</strong> on every successful sale. With a solid 30-day cookie duration and a high Average Order Value (most fans buy 4+ items or full sets!), your earning potential is substantial.</p><p><strong>• How to promote us:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Content Creators:</strong> Create engaging ASMR unboxing videos or showcase our figures in your cozy desk setups on TikTok/YouTube.</p></li><li><p><strong>Deal Sites &amp; Community Leaders:</strong> Share our links in your Discord, Reddit, Telegram, or Facebook deal groups.</p></li><li><p><strong>Exclusive Vanity Codes:</strong> We can provide you with a custom discount code of <strong>up to 10% OFF</strong> (e.g., YourName10) to drastically boost your conversion rates without relying solely on link clicks!</p></li></ul><p><strong>• Other information:</strong>The ultimate conversion killer: We offer <strong>FREE SHIPPING on all orders over $50</strong>. Use this massive incentive to encourage your audience to buy full sets! Commissions are paid reliably and on time via PayPal. Join the FUNISM family today and start monetizing your traffic!</p></div>",
